      <p>Both visa holders can theoretically access the Beckham Law, but in practice the DNV population is far more likely to qualify. The Beckham Law (Régimen Especial para Trabajadores Desplazados) requires that you have not been tax resident in Spain in the five years before arrival. Most DNV applicants, by definition, have been working abroad and arrive from outside Spain, easily meeting this requirement.</p>

